FUN_0000_c31e (object action-dispatch, reached via b51f's spawn / bb64-found target, patch 253):
double-deref base-loss + wrong dispatch arg (SIGSEGV).

ROOT CAUSE (asm-verified 0xc31e-0xc334): c31e dispatches an object's type-indexed action method.
param_3 is the object near offset (si); asm sets di=si (object live), si=word[DS:si] (type), and calls
word[DS:type*2-0x1ab0] with DI=object.  Ghidra double-derefed *param_3 as a host int* (wild) and passed
param_4 to the method instead of the object.  Fix: object = g_mem+0x1c000+param_3; action method =
word[DGROUP:type*2-0x1ab0], near-called with di (object) live.  Mission-cascade only.
